Sughra Sughra Zainab Ye Aayi Sughra<br>
Bhai Ki Apne Hathoun Se Turbat Banayi Sughra<br>
<br>
Sughra Zamin-e-karbobala Khoon Se Lal Hai<br>
Pamal Ran Me Ho Chuka Shabbar Ka Lal Hai<br>
Kubra Dulhan Ko Pal Me Bewa Banayi Sughra<br>
<br>
Hathoun Me Resma The Aur Paoun Me Bediyan<br>
Katoun Pa Chalke Aaya Hai Bimar Natawan<br>
Sarta Qadam Bani Hoon Gham Ki Duhayi Sughra<br>
<br>
Qasim Nahi Raha Mera Bhai Nahi Raha<br>
Dhoudo Na Usko Bibi Tum Asghar Nahi Raha<br>
Ek Do Paher Me Ghar Mera Apna Lutayi Sughra<br>
<br>
Gazi Nahi Raha Mera Akber Nahi Raha<br>
Hathoun Ko De-Chuka Mera Bhai Nahi Raha<br>
Balwe Me Be-Rida Hui Zehra Ki Jayi Sughra<br>
<br>
Bhai Ka Khoon Bhara Hua Kurta Mai Layi Hoon<br>
Sath Apne Dekho Ek Ye Tohfa Mai Layi Hoon<br>
Karbobala Me Lut-Gayi Maa Ki Kamayi Sughra<br>
<br>
Binte Ali Ka Dekhiye Kya Haal Aaj Hai<br>
Gham Fatima Ke Lal Ka Iqbal Aaj Hai<br>
Zinda Me Rehgayi Teri Khwahar Na Aayi Sughra